<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <view class="eyebrow">身份确认</view>
    <view class="hero-title">绑定我的学员身份</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">输入正式入塾时登记的姓名和手机号；如刚刚解除绑定，也可以在这里重新确认新的学员身份。系统只会显示最小脱敏信息，不会公开查询其他学员。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-card">
    <view class="field-row">
      <view class="field-label">姓名</view>
      <input class="field-input" always-embed="true" placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder" placeholder-style="color:#b7aaaa;" data-field="name" bindinput="handleInput" placeholder="请输入正式姓名" style="color:#3d2a2a;caret-color:#741f2b;background-color:#ffffff;" />
    </view>
    <view class="field-row">
      <view class="field-label">手机号</view>
      <input class="field-input" always-embed="true" placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder" placeholder-style="color:#b7aaaa;" type="number" maxlength="11" data-field="phone" bindinput="handleInput" placeholder="请输入登记手机号" style="color:#3d2a2a;caret-color:#741f2b;background-color:#ffffff;" />
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="bindIdentity">微信登录并确认绑定</button>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-copy">绑定成功后，微信身份只作为登录凭证；平台学习记录始终归属于正式学员 member_id。</view>
</view>
